  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "日焼けしないように\r\n気をつけよう",
    "nextLabel": "1006001000813"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001000810030,
    "label": "1006001000811",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いい天気にはいい出会いがつきものだからね\r\nいろいろな場所に出向きたくなる気持ちもわかるよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100081/1006001000810030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001000810040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "レッスンが終わったら、一緒に散歩でもしないかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100081/1006001000810040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001000810050,
    "label": "1006001000812",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、望むところだよ\r\n体がウズウズするね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100081/1006001000810050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001000810060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "今日のレッスンは何かな\r\nいつも通り、全力で臨むことにしよう",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100081/1006001000810060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001000810070,
    "label": "1006001000813",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "確かに紫外線には気をつけないとね\r\nまあ、多少日焼けした姿も健康的でいいと思わないかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
